&lt;p&gt;The data shows buying AI coding tools is cheaper for 9 out of 10 startups under 50 engineers (Gartner, 2026). The average custom LLM setup (including model fine-tuning) costs $17,800 upfront, plus $360/month in inference and infra. Off-the-shelf tools? $10-19/user/month, plug-and-play.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here’s the thing nobody tells you: even top-tier AI devs underestimate ongoing costs. OpenAI API usage, codebase migrations, and legal reviews add up fast. Unless you’re building core AI IP, rent the tools, not the pain.&lt;/p&gt;

